{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23328","headline":"啄木曲 · 白居易","name":"啄木曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫买宝剪刀，虚费千金直。\n我有心中愁，知君剪不得。\n莫磨解结锥，徒劳人气力。\n我有肠中结，知君解不得。\n莫染红丝线，徒夸好颜色。\n我有双泪珠，知君穿不得。\n莫近红炉火，炎气徒相逼。\n我有两鬓霜，知君销不得。\n刀不能剪心愁，锥不能解肠结。\n线不能穿泪珠，火不能销鬓雪。\n不如饮此神圣桮，万念千忧一时歇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}